> I would go with {bangr,ko,re,a} but I'm not sure.

{ban,gr,ko,r=C3=A9,a}. The "r" is a syllabic consonant, which is ignored wh=
en=20
placing stress.

> Yes, I see that the explicit mark of accent is only needed for cmevla.

